ion"},{"text":"Project status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then produce:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Evidence","Root cause","Intervention","Budget","Implementation plan","KPI","Review mechanism"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is an excellent portfolio project for municipal administration."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Municipal Administration"},{"text":"Governance + administration"},{"text":"Senior Municipal Officer"}],[{"text":"Urban Governance"},{"text":"Policy + civic services"},{"text":"Urban Governance Specialist"}],[{"text":"Municipal Finance"},{"text":"Finance + public budgeting"},{"text":"Municipal Finance Officer"}],[{"text":"E-Governance"},{"text":"Technology + administration"},{"text":"Digital Governance Lead"}],[{"text":"Solid Waste Management"},{"text":"Environment + operations"},{"text":"Urban Waste Programme Lead"}],[{"text":"Water Governance"},{"text":"Infrastructure + policy"},{"text":"Water Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Public Health Administration"},{"text":"Health + administration"},{"text":"Urban Health Administrator"}],[{"text":"Urban Development"},{"text":"Infrastructure + policy"},{"text":"Urban Development Specialist"}],[{"text":"Property Tax"},{"text":"Revenue + data"},{"text":"Municipal Revenue Officer"}],[{"text":"Smart Cities"},{"text":"Technology + urban systems"},{"text":"Smart City Programme Lead"}],[{"text":"Public Procurement"},{"text":"Procurement + law"},{"text":"Procurement Specialist"}],[{"text":"Citizen Services"},{"text":"CX + administration"},{"text":"Citizen Services Lead"}],[{"text":"Urban Climate Policy"},{"text":"Climate + governance"},{"text":"Urban Climate Specialist"}],[{"text":"Disaster Management"},{"text":"Risk + administration"},{"text":"Urban Resilience Specialist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"A BA Honours Public Administration student should use additional coursework to 